items.text:
Scroll masking with CSS scroll animation as a progressive enhancement ⭐️

.scroller {
animation: mask-up;
animation-timeline: scroll(self);
animation-range: 0 1rem;
mask-composite: exclude;
}
@​keyframes mask-up {
to { mask-size: 100% 120px, 100% 100%; }
}

