items.text:
you can create this dynamic mask using a progressive CSS scroll-driven animation 🧑‍🍳

the gist 👇

input {
animation: in;
animation-timeline: scroll(self inline);
animation-range: 0 6ch;
mask-position: 0 0;
}
@​keyframes in { 0% { mask-position: -6ch 0; }}

